   "instructorFeedback": {
    "rawText": "<p>A few things I noticed</p><p>1) There is an issue with special character encoding. The director Allfonso Curaón has a special character in his last name that is rendered incorrectly if you open this file in OpenRefine or Excel, but correctly in NotePad and other editors.</p><p>2) There is a semantic inconsistency in the Duration column. The implied meaning of duration would be the elapsed time, e.g., 90 minutes, but some entries have \"1 Season\" which is a different interpretation of duration.</p><p>3) Description has placeholder value of \"Description of show.\" in all 860 rows which qualifies all of them as \"missing values\". Even though all values are non-blank/non-null values, they are not the actual descriptions.</p>",
    "displayText": "<div class=\"vtbegenerated\">\n <p>A few things I noticed</p>\n <p>1) There is an issue with special character encoding. The director Allfonso Curaón has a special character in his last name that is rendered incorrectly if you open this file in OpenRefine or Excel, but correctly in NotePad and other editors.</p>\n <p>2) There is a semantic inconsistency in the Duration column. The implied meaning of duration would be the elapsed time, e.g., 90 minutes, but some entries have \"1 Season\" which is a different interpretation of duration.</p>\n <p>3) Description has placeholder value of \"Description of show.\" in all 860 rows which qualifies all of them as \"missing values\". Even though all values are non-blank/non-null values, they are not the actual descriptions.</p>\n</div>",
    "webLocation": "https://blackboard.ualr.edu/sessions/61/6131887FF2C698D71B10F38F5D61FE0F/3a4e10c6d6e24fe28cfae4065094d1ad/",
